id: pm-5md8n7
title: "PR1559: keep command admission linear and recovery startup lightweight"
description: Exact-head CodeQL alert 50 flags the sticky assignment-name expression. Runtime-only CI artifacts fail before version output because error guidance now imports the broad runtime-primitives value graph. Replace assignment-name matching with a character scan and route positional recovery through the existing lightweight SDK recovery seam.
