parent: pm-gh1555
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Assignment names use a character scan; early CLI guidance consumes the existing lightweight SDK command-recovery seam rather than the broad host-runtime value graph.
expected_result: "No new CodeQL alert, dependency-free version startup, and preserved SDK/CLI recovery and refusal contracts."
actual_result: "83 linked regression tests pass including copied-dist version output without node_modules and long scanner inputs. Source/static components, type checking, generated surfaces and refreshed dependency advisory gate pass. Exact-head hosted CodeQL, runtime smoke, full coverage and review remain merge conditions."
