comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T11:37:48.078Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: request-specific PR1559 search plus fresh open and in_progress lists found no review-remediation owner. This is pre-merge feedback on https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1559 and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/security/code-scanning/50. Keep completed implementation items closed and claim only this active review scope."
  "2026-10-23T11:41:40.016Z","harness:codex","Review remediation: replaced the sticky variable-name expression with a single-character scan and added 100000-character names plus 10000 repeated assignments as negative controls. Re-exported positional recovery through the lightweight command-recovery module already used by early error guidance; no private-import allowlist expansion. Linked suites pass 61 admission/recovery/integration cases plus 22 existing runtime-compatibility cases, including copied-dist version output without node_modules. Fresh required observability gate passes with zero blocking Sentry issues, 4.5 percent seven-day telemetry error rate and no missing error-code rows."
  "2026-10-23T11:45:38.926Z","harness:codex","The source/architecture, absence-tolerance, token-budget, context-intent calibration, docs/skills and defect-evidence components pass. Repository assurance initially refused a stale or invalid advisory receipt; the standalone dependency advisory gate now completes successfully with current feed evidence. No thresholds, allowlists or receipt validation were relaxed. Type checking and generated SDK/capability checks pass."
